stream file and every event already appended to it. The writer still reports `persistence: 'durable'`.\n\nTrack the directories that `mkdir` creates. Sync the parent of the shallowest created directory, and sync each created directory's parent down to `streamDir`. Keep the existing syncs. If callers always pre-create `journalDir` durably, the writer can instead refuse a `journalDir` that does not already exist. That choice belongs to the caller contract.","id":"d51830c653a24ecaed818643eadd58c98c35501640e7a6cdffbfa2d62d4247af","intervals":[[220,220]],"path":"src/kernel/observation.ts","severity":"minor","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Sync each directory entry created by `openObservationWriter`, up to the first existing ancestor."}],"head":"7c474570e674f03c5b01c75b3a32c05505195c41","head_tree":"51ba50b1b1dd4985afa637ff27d9e12676620073","input_scope":[{"blob":"f71aa16ff1ed5ab7130229e88784a4d52ea99fe5","intervals":[[1,587]],"path":"src/kernel/observation.ts"}],"job_id":"73ae41a61378433b76b88550534891910b93ac2fc3d71723dea2a4ff6581fb7f:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"f71aa16ff1ed5ab7130229e88784a4d52ea99fe5","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/kernel/observation.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"f71aa16ff1ed5ab7130229e88784a4d52ea99fe5","intervals":[[44,44],[64,75],[77,90],[92,102],[372,372],[376,383],[418,434],[515,520],[558,573],[579,579]],"path":"src/kernel/observation.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"f71aa16ff1ed5ab7130229e88784a4d52ea99fe5","intervals":[[44,44],[64,75],[77,90],[92,102],[372,372],[376,383],[418,434],[515,520],[558,573],[579,579]],"path":"src/kernel/observation.ts"}],"scope_digest":"e387df0b7e70431d0064f6f8caddd8b3488015131283505c104ed1775d7ad041","source":{"authenticated":true,"id":"backfill-73ae41a613